test: What area, in square meters, does a rectangular car park in Vancouver cover if it is {w} m across and {l} m long?
test: A quilt is made of {l} columns of patches with {w} patches in each column. How many patches are in the quilt?
test: The floor of a rectangular classroom in Dublin is {l} m long and {w} m wide. How much floor space does it have, in square meters?
